  objectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37e2d4235c362bc44b6e417bfb2cda8a, type: 3}
  questDescription: Captain Pip here! My rocket rattles like a tin can on every launch,
    so a little more sturdiness would be nice. But I want it SO fast that I overtake
    the moon! Oh, and she guzzles fuel, so please do something about that too.
  requirements:
  - type: 2
    tier: 3
  - type: 1
    tier: 1
  - type: 4
    tier: 0
  successText: Whoooosh! I overtook the moon and I still have fuel left!
  partialText: Okay, it flies. Not what I imagined, but fine.
  failureText: It exploded on the launch pad! My eyebrows are gone!
